'''Caster level:''' [[druid]] 9

'''Innate level:''' 9 

'''School:''' [[transmutation]]

'''Component(s):''' V, S 

'''Range:''' short

'''Save:''' [[fortitude]] negates 

'''Spell resistance:''' yes

'''Area of effect/target:''' huge

'''Duration:''' instant

'''Description:''' The caster creates water in the lungs of the target [[creature]]s. Any drowned creature takes 90% of its current [[hit point]]s as damage. [[Construct|Golems]] and other nonliving creatures cannot be drowned.

